title: Broken Commitments
subtitle: Our promises to [+ coalition_indy_breach_partners +] have gone unfulfilled.
new-page: true
tags: event
role: event
view-if: coalition_indy_breach_trigger
on-arrival: {!
    Q.coalition_indy_breach_trigger = false;
    Q.coalition_rupture_recheck = true;
    Q.coalition_indy_breach_partners = "";
    for (var record of Q.coalition_indy_commitments || []) {
        if (record.status != "broken") continue;
        if (!Q.cat_coalition.includes(record.target)) {
            record.status = "retired";
            continue;
        }
        Q[record.target + "_relations"] -= 15;
        Q.coalition_indy_breach_partners += (Q.coalition_indy_breach_partners ? ", " : "") + record.target;
        record.status = "penalized";
    }
!}

= Broken Commitments

We promised to push further in our independence aspirations a year ago, yet the deadline has passed without any meaningful progress. Our partners ([+ coalition_indy_breach_partners +]) are, unsurprisingly, very disappointed. We'll have to see if the relations can even be mended at this point.

